   622                                  ; Program the canonical 64-entry EGA-compatible VGA DAC palette.
   623                                  ; Standard 16-color Attribute Controller mappings select DAC entries including
   624                                  ; 14h (brown) and 38h-3Fh (bright colors).
   625                                  load_ega64_dac:
   626 000004D1 50                          push ax
