  1853                                      ; IBM VGA/XGA Technical Reference, Video BIOS Interface, INT 10h
  1854                                      ; AH=10h/AL=15h: BX selects one DAC register and the BIOS returns its
  1855                                      ; red/green/blue components in DH/CH/CL.  A program is entitled to save
