    22          ******************  <1>  warning: 16-bit absolute section-crossing relocation [-w+reloc-abs-word]
    23 00000DEE 268C0EAA00          <1>     mov word [es:0xAA], cs
    24 00000DF3 07                  <1>     pop es
    25 00000DF4 58                  <1>     pop ax
    26 00000DF5 C3                  <1>     ret
